        "speaker_alignment": "Her paraphrase — 'if the world hates you, keep in mind it hated me first' — captures John 15:18 accurately without altering its meaning, and citing it as 'the gospel of John 15:18' correctly identifies the source. She applies it appropriately to the hostility Alex is receiving after her conversion.",
