        "speakerText": "if he engages you, he's a domineering man. And if he doesn't engage you, he's a doormat. It's a lose-lose for a man.",
        "claim": "When a wife publicly picks a fight with her husband, online, before his children, family, or coworkers, it puts him in a lose-lose position: responding makes him look domineering, not responding makes him look like a doormat.",
