        "claim_type": "scripture_citation",
        "time": "0:55",
        "speakerText": "A wise woman builds her home, but a foolish woman tears it down with her own hands.",
        "claim": "A wife's wisdom or folly is decisive for her household, she either builds it up or tears it down with her own hands, and wives generally hold more power over their husbands and homes than they realize.",
        "cited_reference": null,
