        "id": "c3",
        "claim_type": "scripture_citation",
        "time": "1:03",
        "speakerText": "Genesis 3:9, but the Lord God called to who? The man and said to him, 'Where are you?'",
        "claim": "Genesis 3:9 shows God calling out to Adam first after the fall, which the speaker takes as evidence Adam held primary accountability as leader.",
        "cited_reference": "Genesis 3:9",
