        "speakerText": "who ends up becoming the head of household and leader of the family? Satan. The man does not activate. So then the woman steps into the gap. Satan deceives her, takes over the whole family.",
        "claim": "When a man fails to lead (\"does not activate\"), his wife is left to step into the leadership gap, and Satan exploits this to take control of the family.",
        "cited_reference": null,
